{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify Liquid and CSS developer. Write the complete, production-ready code for a custom Shopify theme section that replicates the layout of image_b95d21.png 100% with exact visual precision, while modifying the initials badge to be a dedicated image picker for the CEO's profile photo.
    
    ### Section Configuration & Schema Requirements:
    1. Wrap the entire code in a fully customizable Shopify section.
    2. Include a settings schema so the merchant can customize:
       - CEO Profile Image picker (this replaces the "CP" initials block seen in image_b95d21.png).
       - Kicker/Top small text (default: "FROM THE CEO").
       - Name heading text (default: "Chad Peshke").
       - Biography/Description paragraph text (default: "Founder & CEO of Flow. Writing about retail operations, execution infrastructure, and building software for the physical world.").
       - Social Media Links: Text inputs for LinkedIn URL and Twitter/X URL. If a URL setting is empty, its respective icon button should hide dynamically.
    3. Include standard `{% schema %}` with presets so it can be added directly via the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ### Visual & Style Specifications (1:1 Replication):
    1. **Layout Structure:**
       - A clean, full-width section with a solid white background (`#ffffff`).
       - Inner content container centered with appropriate horizontal padding, using a flex row layout on desktop to align the profile block and text info side-by-side. 
       - Ensure a comfortable gap between the avatar container and the text column exactly matching the spatial proportion in image_b95d21.png. On mobile, elements should stack vertically with clean alignment.
    
    2. **Left Column (CEO Image Block - Modified Structure):**
       - The avatar container must preserve the identical structural framing of the dark blue badge in image_b95d21.png: a distinct squircle / heavily rounded square shape (`border-radius: 24px` or `20%`), with a sharp aspect ratio of 1:1 (fixed width and height, approx. 110px to 120px on desktop).
       - Instead of the placeholder initials, this container must display a high-resolution image uploaded via the Shopify image picker. The image must use `object-fit: cover` and `width: 100%; height: 100%;` to flawlessly fill the squircle frame without distortion.
    
    3. **Right Column (Author Information Stack):**
       - **Kicker Text:** Small, uppercase, semi-bold font in a muted slate/blue-gray color (`#64748b`), reading "FROM THE CEO".
       - **Name Heading:** Large, prominent, heavy bold typography using a deep dark navy blue (`#0a3263`), positioned with minimal top margin directly under the kicker text.
       - **Biography Text:** A clean, left-aligned paragraph using a neutral, highly readable slate-gray font color (`#475569`). Maintain comfortable line-height and letter-spacing to match the clean, professional editorial feel of the reference image.
       - **Social Icon Buttons:** Positioned horizontally in a row beneath the biography text with a slight top margin. Each icon (LinkedIn and Twitter) is enclosed inside a small, subtly rounded square button border (`border: 1px solid #e2e8f0`, `border-radius: 8px`). The background of the buttons is transparent or white, and the icons inside are a clean, thin, muted gray outline.
    
    Output only the clean, copy-pasteable code containing the HTML structure, embedded CSS (or Tailwind utility classes), and the Shopify Liquid schema.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-ceo-profile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 60px 20px;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-avatar-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 112px;
    height: 112px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #0a3263;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-avatar-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #0a3263;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-kicker-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #64748b;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0a3263;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-bio-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #475569;
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-social-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background-color: transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    border-color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .ai-ceo-profile-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    stroke: #64748b;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-ceo-profile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }

    .ai-ceo-profile-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .ai-ceo-profile-avatar-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .ai-ceo-profile-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ai-ceo-profile-bio-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .ai-ceo-profile-social-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<ceo-profile-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-ceo-profile-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-ceo-profile-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-ceo-profile-avatar-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.ceo_image %}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.ceo_image | image_url: width: 224 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.ceo_name | escape }}"
          class="ai-ceo-profile-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          width="112"
          height="112"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-ceo-profile-avatar-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          CP
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-ceo-profile-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.kicker_text != blank %}
        <p class="ai-ceo-profile-kicker-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.kicker_text }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.ceo_name != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-ceo-profile-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.ceo_name }}</h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.bio_text != blank %}
        <p class="ai-ceo-profile-bio-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.bio_text }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="ai-ceo-profile-social-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.linkedin_url != blank %}
          <a
            href="{{ block.settings.linkedin_url }}"
            class="ai-ceo-profile-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="LinkedIn"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"></path>
              <rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"></rect>
              <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle>
            </svg>
          </a>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.twitter_url != blank %}
          <a
            href="{{ block.settings.twitter_url }}"
            class="ai-ceo-profile-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Twitter"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4l11.733 16h4.267l-11.733 -16z"></path>
              <path d="M4 20l6.768 -6.768m2.46 -2.46l6.772 -6.772"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</ceo-profile-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class CeoProfile{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }
    }

    customElements.define('ceo-profile-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CeoProfile{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "CEO profile",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "CEO image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "ceo_image",
      "label": "Profile photo"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "kicker_text",
      "label": "Kicker text",
      "default": "FROM THE CEO"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ceo_name",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "Chad Peshke"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "bio_text",
      "label": "Biography",
      "default": "Founder & CEO of Flow. Writing about retail operations, execution infrastructure, and building software for the physical world."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Social media"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "linkedin_url",
      "label": "LinkedIn URL"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "twitter_url",
      "label": "Twitter/X URL"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "CEO profile"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
